        "content": "## Irama Nusantara ### #4 with Renovan Reza Irama Nusantara returns in 2014 with a mix by the one and only Renovan Reza. Be sure to play close attention to the music in this mix, some of them are gems that have become Whiteboard Journal favorites! Be sure to visit Iramanusantara.com and follow Renovan Reza on twitter: @renokrl 01.Buana Suara - Awas Ada Andjing 02.The Friendly Group Aria - Taman Marga Satwa 03.Two Faces - Hidup Bersama Musik 04.Panbers - Si Kera 05.Bimbo - Disco 06.The Rollies - Sign of Love 07.Kembar Group - Caci Maki 08.Franky Manoppo & 4 Nada - Ngeganja 09.Blo’on - Cek-Ecek Wow 10.John Philips & the Steps - Ayo ke Disco 11.Aria Yunior - Salah Tingkah 12.Machyoel & Rhapsodia - Kepalsuan 13.Diana Papilaya - Om Leo ### #3 with Lian Nasution Irama Nusantara is back with its third episode, and this time guesting is everybody's favorite Jalan Surabaya record store owner, Lian Nasution! Owner of Lian Records, if you have ever stopped by his shop then you'll know that he is a friendly man who is eager to share his music knowledge to visitors willing to learn. Sharing is exactly what he does here with a 13 song selection for Irama Nusantara 01. Lies Embarsary & Zaenal Combo - Ngawuluku 03. Bimbo - Kerakap Di Atas Batu 06. Ogle Eyes - Joget Di Udara 10. Murry’s Group - Ajojing 11. Do Re Mi Group - Tiada Kasih Sayang 12. ### #2 with Imanuel Tondok The second episode of Irama Nusantara has guest Imanuel Tondok aka Manu Shanker (twitter: @imanuel414)share his selection of groovy Indonesian tunes, so click play and enjoy the music! Melky Goeslaw & De Meicy \"Ombak-Ombak Yang Ganas\" 10. ### #1 The first episode of Irama Nusantara is here! Click to stream or download, and definitely enjoy this mix of Indonesian music. Over 36-minutes of tunes for you to enjoy. 1. Zaenal Combo \"Njiur\" 2. Eka Djaja Combo \"Angkat Sampeong\" 4. Andi Meriem Matalatta \"Hati Yang Sepi\" ## Subscribe to the Whiteboard Journal newsletter ### Good stuff coming to y